        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\rToday&apos;s contract comes from a bank director. He&apos;s noticed a few slackers among his staff, particularly in the IT department. While their lack of productivity is an issue, he is well aware that you don’t mess with IT personnel lightly. Despite this, he wants you to take care of them... permanently.",
